// The lawful twin, and the only thing that changed is that the promises are
// now written down. The intents, the rights and the interactions are the ones
// the unlawful twin already declared.
//
// One role is enough to silence the advisory: it reports a surface that has
// not met the vocabulary at all, not a surface that declared some roles and
// not others. A per-control count would be a requirement wearing a warning's
// clothes, and requiring a role is what the Principal ruled NOT YET.
//
// Expected: clean

DEFINE INTERACTION export_ledger (
  SATISFIES [ACT],
  ALWAYS_REACHABLE [UNDO],
  ROLE reversible
)

DEFINE INTERACTION open_details (
  SATISFIES [READ]
)
